| In-app purchase catalogue, entitlement service, refunds and compliance | requires-decision | Explicitly required, but monetisation is also deferred and no platform/payment policy exists. | Required and deferred capabilities |
| Analytics/telemetry | deferred | Advanced analytics is explicitly later/deferred; minimum crash diagnostics must still observe privacy policy. | Later/deferred capabilities |
| Seasonal/live events and player-created/shared content | deferred | Directly enumerated as later scope. | Later/deferred capabilities |
| Repository, engine/framework, backend, vendors, CI and cost model | requires-decision | The source instructs these constraints to be determined; no selection is authorized. | Constraints and non-goals |
